flowchart TB
  subgraph T1[Tier 1 - always injected]
    A1[Normative behaviour and mechanics contracts - low sensitivity]
    A2[Style, preferences and identity - low to medium sensitivity]
    A3[Cue and pointer file - declared low sensitivity, observed medium to high]
  end
  subgraph T2[Tier 2 - runtime selected per new session]
    B1[Recent dated notes within a bounded window and character budget]
    B2[Injected block wrapped in an untrusted-content header]
  end
  subgraph T3[Tier 3 - retrieved on demand only]
    C1[Dated notes and machine-written session summaries]
    C2[Evergreen topic files - variable sensitivity]
    C3[Conditional high-sensitivity files - never default loaded]
  end
  RATE[Per-file sensitivity rating - low, medium or high]
  LOAD[Per-file load default - always, conditional or never]
  AXES[Two independent axes - the tier says when a file loads, the rating says what is in it]
  IDX[Semantic and lexical index over the whole corpus]
  S[Agent turn]
  WRITE[Explicit operator write request]
  AUDIT[Audit hook records the write]
  T1 --> S
  T2 --> S
  T3 -. search then narrow read .-> S
  RATE --> AXES
  LOAD --> AXES
  AXES -. rate every file individually .-> A3
  IDX -. indexes every tier without a sensitivity filter .-> T1
  IDX -. indexes every tier without a sensitivity filter .-> T3
  WRITE --> AUDIT
  AUDIT --> C1
